## Interface: 16001
## Title: SnardgeUtils
## Notes: Small quality of life tools for WoW Forever. Mark bag items to sell, bank or mail, show xp/hr and pending quest XP on the experience bar, a self-updating target macro for nearby quest mobs, a low health warning sound, LFG filters and more. /su opens the settings.
## Author: Snardge
## Category: Quality of Life
## Version: 1.1.1
## X-License: MIT
## OptionalDeps: Bagnon, Questie, Leatrix_Plus, Mastercraft, TradeSkillMaster
